  "description": "## What is this?\nA slim and simple client to handle HTML emails in .NET 10+ for MailKit. This client allows you to send emails via MailKit rendered by the Razor view engine, including helpers for CSS inlining, absolute URLs, and CID support for inline/embedded images.",
